# DEFAULT-DENY. Nothing here is committed unless it is named below.
#
# This directory holds the evidence behind ASSET_LICENCES.md, and it mixes two
# kinds of document with very different handling:
#
#   terms/    Suno's Terms of Service, as captured on the generation date.
#             Public documents, no personal data, and the load-bearing evidence:
#             the 26 Mar 2026 text is the one the music was licensed under and
#             was replaced on the site on 3 Sep 2026. TRACKED, on purpose.
#
#   private/  Invoice and payment receipt. These carry a billing name, a home
#             address, an email and a partial card number, and THIS REPOSITORY
#             IS PUBLIC. Never committed. ASSET_LICENCES.md records only their
#             invoice and receipt numbers, which is all a reviewer needs to ask
#             the account holder for the originals.
#
# The rule is inverted - ignore everything, then re-admit - so that a file
# dropped in the wrong place is silently ignored rather than silently committed.
# That is the failure worth engineering against here.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!terms/
!terms/*.pdf
